---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import TimeLineElement from "../components/cv/TimeLine.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Resume" sideBarActiveItemID="cv">
  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Profile</div>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-10 text-justify">
    I'm a seasoned Next.js developer with robust experience in backend
    development using Golang, Node.js, and FastAPI. My expertise extends to
    deploying real production applications in Docker containers, ensuring
    scalability and efficiency. Additionally, I possess a solid understanding of
    frontend frameworks like Svelte, Angular, and Astro, allowing me to create
    seamless, high-performance user interfaces. My diverse skill set enables me
    to build full-stack applications that are both innovative and reliable.
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Education</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container grid gap-4 mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="B.tech, EEE"
      subtitle="2018 to 2024 at Amrita University, Coimbatore, India"
    />
    <TimeLineElement
      title="High School"
      subtitle="2016 to 2018 at Senthil Public School, Salem, India"
    />
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Experience</div>
  </div>

  <div class="time-line-container mb-10">
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Backend Developer"
      subtitle="From May 2025 at Truvanta, Chennai">
      <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
        <li>
          Managing the IT infrastructure and networking of the office premise.
          We do have a pretty elaborate setup with network under cloudflare
          tunnel with devices managed by intune policies with bitlocker enabled
          for a additional layer of security
        </li>
        <li>
          Maintain the CI/CD setup which includes docker on k8 clusters with
          build systems which is running on proxmox servers located in various
          locations around the globe
        </li>
        <li>
          Build scalable backend solutions for the platform which includes
          connecting with the frontend via rest and websockets and to deployed
          software through grpc protocol for efficiency. The codebase also has
          workers constantly running to perform cleanup operations and do tasks
          on the agent hosts
        </li>
        <li>
          Setup the validation setup, OpenAPI spec generator which now acts as
          the communication layer between the backend and the frontend team
          where the spec file gives the typescript fetch client which the
          frontend application uses eliminating the need for back and forth
          changes and discussions.
        </li>
        <li>
          Plan out the user flow and the technical details for new features on
          the application. We go though a process of documentation and approval
          of the flow with the internal team before proceeding to implementation
          and keep the document as archive for future reference
        </li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Software Developer Engineer - 1"
      subtitle="From Jan 2024 to May 2025 at Teachedison, Coimbatore">
      <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
        <li>
          Developed micro saas tools for marketing campaigns which helped grow
          traffic to the main site by 20%. Maintained the application all the
          way from designing UI, db tables to deployments and database
          migrations to uptime of more than 98%
        </li>
        <li>
          Helped setup the base foundation for the revamp of the main
          application with api specification document with openapi to generate
          typescript client, setup micro application with turborepo and ui
          library and kicked off the base setup with the implementation of the
          base authentication setup
        </li>
        <li>
          Helped reduce running costs by embedding forms in the marketing site
          using full stack application instead of using webflow forms which is
          very limited with validations and costs per entry
        </li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>
    <TimeLineElement
      title="Trainee Consultant"
      subtitle="From Oct 2023 to Jan 2024 at Applexus, Trivandrum">
      <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
        <li>
          Built expertise on the foundations of web development which includes
          css, typescript, middleware, rest api etc along with the frameworks of
          angular and express js as that is the stack that the company is using
        </li>
        <li>
          Helped the team with SAP Fiori to web application with analytics data
          for the teams to easily refer the data
        </li>
        <li>
          Helped the team with cleaning up redundant data in the database which
          came from random testing to enable back the smooth workflow, with my
          efforts being well-recognized by the team, making me the go-to person
          for debugging tasks
        </li>
        <li>Setup a rule engine with multi step form as a POC</li>
      </ul>
    </TimeLineElement>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Certifications (with link)</div>
  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc mx-6 mb-10 grid gap-2">
    <li>
      <a
        href="https://www.boot.dev/certificate/lostboot50/3b39d0f6-f944-4f1b-832d-a1daba32eda4"
        target="_blank"
        >Boot.dev's Learn Go Course
      </a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a
        href="https://certificates.cs50.io/bf85e0a3-fe88-4281-badc-948d55a269d1.pdf?size=letter"
        target="_blank">
        CS50's Introduction to Computer Science</a
      >
    </li>
    <li>
      <a
        href="https://www.coursera.org/account/accomplishments/specialization/certificate/PAEF3VXVBNB4"
        target="_blank">Google Project Management Certificate</a
      >
    </li>
    <li>
      <a
        href="https://www.coursera.org/account/accomplishments/specialization/certificate/NLAT8P4VQJS9"
        target="_blank">IBM Full Stack Software Developer Specialization</a
      >
    </li>
  </ul>

  <div class="mb-5">
    <div class="text-3xl w-full font-bold">Skills</div>
  </div>

  <ul class="list-disc md:columns-5 columns-2 mx-6">
    <li>Golang</li>
    <li>Gin</li>
    <li>SQL</li>
    <li>Docker</li>
    <li>Kubernetes</li>
    <li>Azure DevOps</li>
    <li>Linux</li>
    <li>PostgreSQL</li>
    <li>NextJS</li>
    <li>AstroJS</li>
    <li>TypeScript</li>
    <li>Tailwind</li>
    <li>Python</li>
  </ul>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .time-line-container > div:last-child .education__time > .education__line {
    display: none;
  }
  a {
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease-in-out;
  }

  a:hover {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  a:hover:after {
    opacity: 1;
  }
</style>
